  "function_summary": {
    "summary": "Apache HttpComponents Core（HttpCore）是 Apache 基金会出品的 HTTP 传输层核心库，为构建 HTTP 服务端和客户端提供底层传输组件。它实现了 HTTP/1.1（经典阻塞 I/O 和 NIO 异步两种模式）与 HTTP/2 协议的完整语义，包括请求/响应消息模型、连接管理、SSL/TLS 安全层、HPACK 头压缩、流多路复用等核心能力。同时提供 Reactive Streams 绑定和 Jackson JSON 序列化集成，供上层框架（如 HttpClient）或应用直接使用。",
    "categories": [
      {
        "name": "HTTP/1.1 传输（阻塞与异步）",
        "description": "提供经典阻塞 I/O（BIO）和 NIO 异步两种 HTTP/1.1 传输实现，包括消息解析/序列化、连接复用、请求路由、Server/Client Bootstrap 等",
        "evidence": [
          "httpcore5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/core5/http/impl/bootstrap/ServerBootstrap.java",
          "httpcore5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/core5/http/impl/bootstrap/AsyncRequestBuilder.java",
          "httpcore5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/core5/http/impl/nio/ClientHttp1IOEventHandler.java"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "HTTP/2 协议实现",
        "description": "完整实现 HTTP/2 二进制分帧协议，包括 HPACK 头压缩、流多路复用、流控制、优先级、服务器推送等",
        "evidence": [
          "httpcore5-h2/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/core5/http2/impl/nio/AbstractH2StreamMultiplexer.java",
          "httpcore5-h2/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/core5/http2/impl/nio/H2Stream.java"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "NIO 反应器与连接池",
        "description": "基于 Java NIO Selector 的 I/O 反应器框架，支持多工作线程、SOCKS 代理、连接池管理（严格/宽松策略）、SSL/TLS 会话管理",
        "evidence": [
          "httpcore5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/core5/reactor/DefaultConnectingIOReactor.java",
          "httpcore5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/core5/pool/StrictConnPool.java",
          "httpcore5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/core5/reactor/ssl/SSLIOSession.java"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "Reactive Streams 绑定",
        "description": "将 HttpCore 的异步请求/响应模型适配为 Reactive Streams Publisher/Subscriber 接口，便于与 RxJava 等响应式框架集成",
        "evidence": [
          "httpcore5-reactive/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/core5/reactive/"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "Jackson JSON 序列化集成",
        "description": "提供基于 Jackson 2 的 JSON 实体序列化/反序列化支持，简化 HTTP 消息体的 JSON 处理",
        "evidence": [
          "httpcore5-jackson2/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/core5/jackson/"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "SSL/TLS 安全层",
        "description": "封装 javax.net.ssl.SSLContext/SSLEngine 的初始化和握手流程，支持自定义 TrustStrategy、PrivateKeyStrategy、SSLParameters 配置",
        "evidence": [
          "httpcore5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/core5/ssl/SSLContextBuilder.java",
          "httpcore5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/core5/ssl/SSLContexts.java",
          "httpcore5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/core5/reactor/ssl/SSLIOSession.java"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "domain": "网络通信 / HTTP 传输",
    "target_users": "需要在 Java 应用中构建 HTTP 服务端或客户端、或实现自定义 HTTP 传输层的开发者；也是 Apache HttpClient 等上层库的底层依赖"
  },
